{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《新華社》報道，9月30日，慶祝中華人民共和國成立77周年招待會在人民大會堂舉行。當日《新聞聯播》畫面顯示，多名退休上將出席了招待會，包括中央軍委聯合參謀部原參謀長李作成。</p><figure><img alt=\"李作成上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183737119755997184493276.jpeg/1tELdp_eroX1mk0tS9wbtgfg2OrnakcYdKJIHHSiSBw\"/><figcaption>李作成上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李作成。（ 中國國防部）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220708/621996866556399616630712.jpeg/Y8F333rvX10I2stb5485Hh9CjD0zp3zNxc6w5cXOsOU\"/><figcaption>李作成。（ 中國國防部）</figcaption></figure><p>國慶招待會由李強主持，習近平出席並發表重要講話，趙樂際、王滬寧、蔡奇、丁薛祥、李希、韓正出席招待會。約800名中外人士歡聚一堂，共慶中華人民共和國華誕。</p><p>新華社報道指，出席招待會的還有曾擔任中央軍委委員的同志。央視《新聞聯播》畫面顯示，多名退休上將出席了招待會，包括中央軍委聯合參謀部原參謀長李作成、今年96歲高齡的傅全有上將、中共中央軍委原副主席范長龍以及前國防部長常萬全等。李作成此前缺席8月17日舉行的江澤民誕辰100周年大會。</p><figure><img alt=\"傅全有上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183734906195283968937546.jpeg/WzSrxgWpNFRKijeKxdetciObE0POjQgTBbcsqgW3LKo\"/><figcaption>傅全有上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"范長龍上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736707019706368839564.jpeg/esiyL4Xe-vPDfgC7keeJS6eRk-H7W7dJ6UX0SOlF9Eg\"/><figcaption>范長龍上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"常萬全上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736908551819264083946.jpeg/ockVLY-3NW8fRnaznAyhN5SyOErWu_aQXo61P16OtT8\"/><figcaption>常萬全上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"于永波上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183735681696927744395271.jpeg/3-wb1wEJxJI4LEVNlH2Nr3n7lyxcmgMZzomfgc6Jn4E\"/><figcaption>于永波上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曹剛川上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183735815583305728582613.jpeg/ProBpSsWiFE4TRljRbGcT3aUyiCevoLK4HGjs-Bxo7M\"/><figcaption>曹剛川上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"喬清晨上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183735909447634944973518.jpeg/mk-TbAS4rK3wwn5uWngY-iF8Gm3Rg4hb5lpELeZaRC0\"/><figcaption>喬清晨上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳炳德上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736011897704448421830.jpeg/6nKi4y2IU0LNTzZQpKJ3nrZqcvDtTsgP0v_5JdL_-SU\"/><figcaption>陳炳德上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李繼耐上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736114884644864902641.jpeg/YITH7Z6b_Oc0RAUf-S938OSrmk3lukl7R3n2qkd59qo\"/><figcaption>李繼耐上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"靖志遠上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736326835408896952874.jpeg/1CTIWYvEd9CTugVHJ5p8i94F_9ThUzQ4maBTCZmgUwk\"/><figcaption>靖志遠上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳勝利上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736424046792704703958.jpeg/rj9xBoBpv2Bk_lxEgyssaFrozVWgupAbpGm7lKRpu5Q\"/><figcaption>吳勝利上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"趙克石上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183736806969970688296145.jpeg/bdN4vgX9GcpLfxJ5kia85N3WoyUS5CoeWHwmElh8JhI\"/><figcaption>趙克石上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬曉天上將。（新聞聯播截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261005/1183737014273445888526483.jpeg/UEE7YkkWCegYlbiWxq5KcaMo751ACdA6_r_Y0P6_2NA\"/><figcaption>馬曉天上將。（新聞聯播截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T04:38:14.206034+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":512,"images":14,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}